# Milestone: M6 wave 1
# Origin: legacy tests/2.x/lookup.chk
# Covers: unbound-identifier lookup raises a slot-not-found diagnostic.
#
# The legacy fixture's diagnostic format was
#   `!!! input.u:@.1-8: lookup failed: asdfjklm`
#
# NOTE (v0.11.4): slot-not-found is now a CATCHABLE typed TypeError rather
# than a fatal HALT (see tests/chk/exceptions/vm_typeerror_catchable.chk).
# Uncaught at the REPL surface, urbi_repl_eval's THROW→nil recovery renders
# the uncaught throw as `nil` rather than the old `!!! TypeError: ...` line.
# The uncaught-diagnostic degradation is a known follow-up (REPL should
# surface uncaught throws); the catchable behavior is what now matters and
# is exercised by the exceptions fixture.

asdfjklm
[00000000] nil

aoeuhtns
[00000001] nil
